# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Allowlist style: ignore everything,
# then add back only what the Dockerfile copies.
*
!requirements.lock
!src/
!model/support-llm-v3.safetensors

# Belt and braces, in case someone edits the allowlist above.
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.ipynb
